Notable judgment calls:
- Units 2, 3, 4, 6 (fused+wrap together) got a full rejoin-then-resplit at sentence ends, per the wrap repair rule — for unit 6 that meant a 3-line result since three sentence-starts were visible in the window.
- Unit 8 had only a fused finding scoped to line 43; the pre-existing "Use with caution. See StreamPurgeOpt..." fusion on the untouched line was left alone (scope discipline), which ruled out every candidate except c02.
- Unit 5's two separate fused findings both needed resolving, so only the fully-split 3-line candidate (c02) qualified.
